  "content_id": "16136139",
  "title": "Swapuz – Exchange Integration in Edge Wallet",
  "description": "Type: Centralized Exchange (CEX)\nCentralized exchanges must follow anti-money laundering (AML) laws. In order to stay within compliance, t...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Type:</b> Centralized Exchange (CEX)</p><p class=\"no-margin\">Centralized exchanges must follow anti-money laundering (AML) laws. In order to stay within compliance, they may have trading limits and may also require your identity to meet Know Your Customer (KYC) requirements.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Overview:</b> Swapuz is an instant cryptocurrency exchange that supports crypto swaps without registration under most conditions. Known for simplicity and convenience, it allows users to execute trades without complicated registration processes. Swapuz may require KYC if flagged for fraud or risk. Users from restricted jurisdictions are blocked. Refunds may take 1–7 business days or longer, depending on compliance issues and third-party reviews.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Contact Support:</b> Users can reach out to Swapuz support at <a href=\"https://swapuz.com/contact\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">https://swapuz.com/contact</a></p><h1 id=\"h_01JSFZH2219EGA4GYCQHMSR20N\">How to Manage Exchange Settings in Edge</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">To access your exchange settings in Edge Wallet:</p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap the <b>three lines</b> in the upper right-hand corner</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap on <b>Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap <b>Exchange Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Here, you can turn exchange partners <b>on or off</b>, and customize your preferences. When multiple exchanges can fill an order, you can also choose to automatically select the best price or prioritize a preferred exchange.</p></li></ol>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
